lzo1x.c in this directory is part of the Astrolabe project and is released
under CC0 1.0 Universal (see the repository LICENSE at the project root).

The compiled lzo1x binary also incorporates minilzo from lib/lzo (LZO 1.08),
which is licensed under the GNU General Public License v2 or later. See
lib/lzo/COPYING for the full GPL text and lib/lzo/minilzo/ for that source.

Because the binary links GPL code, distributing the built lzo1x executable is
subject to the GPL. The Astrolabe .NET libraries do not link this binary; they
invoke it as a separate process.